{"text":"正光二年八月廿日，比丘慧榮造釋迦像一區。願帝祚永延，榮及姊妹。一切含生，普登彼岸，同登正覺。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"慧榮","refId":null,"text":"慧榮","start":11,"end":13},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"釋迦","refId":null,"text":"釋迦","start":14,"end":16},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"含生","start":33,"end":35},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彼岸","refId":null,"text":"彼岸","start":38,"end":40},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"正覺","refId":null,"text":"正覺","start":43,"end":45}]}